<p>Israeli Defense Minister Israel Katz said Israel plans to keep control of territory in southern Lebanon from the border to the Litani River after the war with Hezbollah ends, and that homes in villages near the border would be demolished. His comments came as Israeli strikes hit the Beirut area overnight. Israel&#x27;s military said it targeted a senior Hezbollah commander and another senior member, while Lebanon&#x27;s health ministry said at least seven people were killed and dozens wounded. The statements suggest Israel is preparing for a longer-term buffer zone in southern Lebanon, which it presents as part of its campaign against the Iran-backed Hezbollah group. The fighting has already taken a severe toll on civilians in Lebanon, with more than 1.2 million people displaced and about 1,200 killed since Israel launched its offensive on March 2, according to figures cited in coverage of the conflict. The U.N. Security Council also held an urgent meeting after three peacekeepers were killed in southern Lebanon, underscoring broader international concern over the escalation.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/QhmxPzaoTV_riq5WaSGDV3YkQoZQIQRqGil4iK6gpsSIGnQIGIVugZaLRTpAwjd_N6GX4UxPiufhQrSNr1qgYaWZLSXM2ZQaxl8MmIr161d5Z8EQoFLYO00z8d9qFvXmLt124iT4xrRZh2M4uFclSx3yr3q0V0aBkP5Uiq0AtMLvE-s1_2lw_wSK284xm2Wwb-R_HbVkFS7Si8qjGMex06lkxrxzjA5sINJ3N0Jul0YxYA' alt='A commercial district in Tyre, Lebanon, heavily damaged by Israeli strikes on Friday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Clearer language: Al-Monitor said Katz&#x27;s remarks were not Israel&#x27;s first declaration about holding parts of southern Lebanon, but they were the clearest such statement since the war spread there.</li><li>Two raids, not one: Israel&#x27;s military said it carried out the Beirut-area operation in two separate strikes.</li><li>Conflict trigger: Coverage said the Lebanon front expanded after Hezbollah opened fire in support of Tehran during the regional war, prompting Israel&#x27;s offensive.</li></ul><blockquote>The entire area - Israel Katz</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Lebanese authorities: Lebanon said Israeli strikes on Tuesday hit near Beirut&#x27;s main airport road, bringing the conflict to a critical civilian access route in the capital. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/strikes-hit-lebanon-israel-vows-occupy-swathe-south-after-war'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/31/world/middleeast/israel-lebanon-ground-invasion.html'>Israel Signals Plans to Occupy Southern Lebanon After Ground Invasion</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/truenews/comments/1s8r86w/israel_to_destroy_all_houses_near_lebanon_border/'>Israel to destroy &#x27;all houses&#x27; near Lebanon border, defence minister says</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c5yx8knpr5no'>Israel says it will keep control over part of southern Lebanon after war with Hezbollah ends</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/strikes-hit-lebanon-israel-vows-occupy-swathe-south-after-war'>Strikes hit Lebanon as Israel vows to occupy swathe of south after war</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/israel-destroy-all-houses-near-lebanon-border-defence-minister-says-2026-03-31/'>Israeli defense minister Israel Katz announces that Israel will destroy &quot;all houses&quot; near the Israel–Lebanon border.</a> - reuters.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/01/israeli-army-says-struck-senior-hezbollah-commander-in-beirut_6752002_4.html'>Israeli army says &#x27;struck senior Hezbollah commander&#x27; in Beirut</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/at-least-seven-killed-in-israeli-strikes-in-beirut-area-lebanon-says'>At least seven killed in Israeli strikes in Beirut area, Lebanon says</a> - straitstimes.com</l